1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Keep GitHub issues and a Google Sheet synchronized,
without manual copying.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
We built a REST integration with a preview. No target is
changed yet.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
An explicit sync wrote 147 issues to the real test Sheet,
then read them back.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Second run: 0 created, 0 updated, 147 unchanged. No
duplicate rows.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,000
A labelled synthetic title change affects one existing issue,
not a new row.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Simulated failure. Local and Sheet status stay separate;
recovery is explicit.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Recovery verified: one row updated, no duplicate. REST
and Sheets, not MCP.
